WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.262 --> 00:00:04.143
MOBIUS
I'm Agent Mobius, by the way.

00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:05.540
LOKI
How long have you been here?

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.857
MOBIUS
I don't know, it's hard to say.

00:00:06.857 --> 00:00:09.310
You know, time passes
differently here in the TVA.

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:10.563
LOKI
What does that mean?

00:00:10.563 --> 00:00:11.588
MOBIUS
You'll catch up.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.585
OWEN WILSON
This is the first time for me

00:00:15.585 --> 00:00:17.601
in the Marvel Universe.

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:22.720
They first spoke to me about Iron Man,
and Captain America, and even Hulk.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.268
I was like,
"Well, you know, I don't know."

00:00:25.268 --> 00:00:26.601
I'm just kidding.

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:29.331
MOBIUS
I need your unique Loki perspective.

00:00:29.331 --> 00:00:32.125
OWEN WILSON
Tom would take us through the world

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:33.434
and the different movies.

00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:35.157
KATE HERRON
It was amazing because he just had

00:00:35.157 --> 00:00:36.627
all this information in his head.

00:00:36.627 --> 00:00:38.564
OWEN WILSON
We called them the Loki lectures.

00:00:38.564 --> 00:00:39.627
[Laughing]

00:00:39.627 --> 00:00:42.754
I ended up just sort of, writing
down some of the stuff he said,

00:00:42.754 --> 00:00:46.834
and I think that it even
worked its way, sometimes, into dialogue.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.183
TOM HIDDLESTON
Owen's full of enthusiasm

00:00:48.183 --> 00:00:49.522
and passion and excitement.

00:00:49.522 --> 00:00:52.046
OWEN WILSON
I really like the whole look.

00:00:52.046 --> 00:00:56.277
The sets and the costumes,
you know, let that do the heavy lifting.

00:00:56.277 --> 00:00:57.277
[Laughing]

